---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Alissa Nicole" current="home">
  <h1>Alissa Nicole</h1>
  <p class="tagline">I build software usually related to sustainability, mostly motivated by my laziness and creativity.</p>
  <p>
    LCA engineer turned product builder, based in the Netherlands. If you work on product
    footprinting, EPDs, or sustainability data infrastructure, this site is for you.
    Here you'll find case studies of tools I've built and where to reach me.
  </p>

  <h2>Professional Play 😏</h2>
  <ul class="projects">
    <li>
      <a href="/work/eol-fixer">The EoL Fixer</a>
      <p>
        The web app that models end-of-life for every Ecochain EPD since 2025: 70% less
        modelling time, auditable across five programme operators.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/eol-report-writer">The EoL Report Writer</a>
      <p>
        The second half of the production line: a skill that assembles verifier-facing
        EoL report sections, every number cited by fact ID.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Leisure Play 🕹️</h2>
  <ul class="projects">
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/lci-graph">LCI·GRAPH</a>
      <p>
        Open-source pipeline that extracts life-cycle inventory data from academic papers
        into a queryable graph.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/paper-trail">The Paper Trail</a>
      <p>
        Context engineering at work: turning scattered client history into governed,
        agent-readable knowledge.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/radar">The Radar</a>
      <p>
        A pipeline that turns public LinkedIn chatter and EU official sources into
        structured, verifiable regulatory intelligence.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/projects/portfarmlio">PORTFARMLIO</a>
      <p>
        My algorithmic trading platform, farming-themed: a strategy-agnostic engine with
        plug-in strategy bundles and a rigor-enforcing backtest harness, paper trading
        by default and live trading double-gated.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Writing</h2>
  <p>
    I write about sustainability, carbon accounting, and the systems around them on <a href="https://scop3.substack.com/">scop3</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
